    "abstract": "Parts figure for the audio integrating installation covering the amplifier rack, the attachment hardware, the feedthrough sleeve and the interphone antenna group in the forward equipment area.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the parts of the audio integrating installation, including the amplifier rack, its attachment hardware and the interphone antenna group.",
      "figure_note": "The rack at item 10 changed with the amplifier obsolescence standard and is shown with pre and post modification effectivity. The two racks are dimensionally identical at the aircraft interface and differ only at the rear connector, which is why the aircraft record must be checked before a rack is ordered. Items 50 and 60 are cabin items and are shown for location only; they are catalogued in full in the cabin chapter."
    },
